{
  "title": "Controller Deep Dive",
  "uid": "controller-deep-dive",
  "tags": [
    "platform-mvp",
    "controller",
    "debug"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Controller Logs",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{namespace=\"default\"} |~ \"(?i)(regionalbucketrequest|reconcil|spoke|created|error|bucket)\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Kubernetes Events \u2014 Controller & Spoke",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=\"kubernetes-events\"} |~ \"(?i)(bucket|kro|regional|binding)\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Reconcile Throughput (by result)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{controller=\"regionalbucketrequest\"}[2m])",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Reconcile Latency Heatmap",
      "type": "heatmap",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_time_seconds_bucket{controller=\"regionalbucketrequest\"}[2m])) by (le)",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "heatmap"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Auth Flow & Connection Architecture",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Multi-Cluster Flow\n\n```\nHub (kind-hub)                         Spoke (kind-eu-storage)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500                      \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nKro RGD expands Bucket\n    \u2193\nRegionalBucketRequest\n    \u2193 (watched by controller)\nController.Reconcile()\n    \u2502\n    \u251c\u25001. Read spec.region = \"eu\"\n    \u2502\n    \u251c\u25002. Region \u2192 cluster: ClusterProfile with\n    \u2502   label region=eu and offers-object-storage\n    \u2502   \u2192 eu-storage (engaged by the provider)\n    \u2502\n    \u251c\u25003. ObjectBucketClaim \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2192 claim created in the\n    \u2502                                tenant namespace\n    \u2514\u25004. Rook provisions the bucket in Ceph RGW\n                                           \u2193\n                              Claim Bound, endpoint ConfigMap written\n                              \u2192 status.regions updated on the hub\n\nAuth: hub-issued projected ServiceAccount token\n      (audience per spoke), validated by the spoke\n      kube-apiserver through AuthenticationConfiguration\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Work Queue Depth",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "controller_runtime_active_workers{controller=\"regionalbucketrequest\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Success Rate (2m)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{controller=\"regionalbucketrequest\",result=\"success\"}[2m])) / sum(rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{controller=\"regionalbucketrequest\"}[2m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.8
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Spoke API Latency (rest_client)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(rest_client_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, rate(rest_client_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Reconciles by Tenant (2m rate)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(bucket_binding_controller_reconcile_total[2m])) by (tenant_id)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Buckets by Namespace (Tenancy Separation)",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{namespace=~\"default|acme-corp|startup-x\"} |= \"bucket\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "P8E80F9AEF21F6940"
      }
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39
}
